    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Track common endpoint and rare intermediate populations for beneficial mutation supply, adaptive response and subsequent replacement. Faster adaptation proportional to population size followed by decline of intermediates supports the mechanism.";
